  "content": "<div class=\"page-links\">Pages: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/the-beatles-white-album/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">1</span></a> <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/the-beatles-white-album/2/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">2</span></a> <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/the-beatles-white-album/3/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">3</span></a> <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/the-beatles-white-album/4/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">4</span></a> <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/the-beatles-white-album/5/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">5</span></a> <span class=\"post-page-numbers current\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"page-link\">6</span></span></div><div id=\"ez-toc-container\" class=\"ez-toc-v2_0_89 ez-toc-wrap-right counter-hierarchy ez-toc-counter ez-toc-grey ez-toc-container-direction\"><div class=\"ez-toc-title-container\"><p class=\"ez-toc-title\" style=\"cursor:inherit\">Contents</p>\n<span class=\"ez-toc-title-toggle\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"ez-toc-pull-right ez-toc-btn ez-toc-btn-xs ez-toc-btn-default ez-toc-toggle\" aria-label=\"Toggle Table of Content\"><span class=\"ez-toc-js-icon-con\"><span class=\"\"><span class=\"eztoc-hide\" style=\"display:none;\">Toggle</span><span class=\"ez-toc-icon-toggle-span\"><svg style=\"fill: #999;color:#999\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"list-377408\" width=\"20px\" height=\"20px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M6 6H4v2h2V6zm14 0H8v2h12V6zM4 11h2v2H4v-2zm16 0H8v2h12v-2zM4 16h2v2H4v-2zm16 0H8v2h12v-2z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg><svg style=\"fill: #999;color:#999\" class=\"arrow-unsorted-368013\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10px\" height=\"10px\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.2\" baseProfile=\"tiny\"><path d=\"M18.2 9.3l-6.2-6.3-6.2 6.3c-.2.2-.3.4-.3.7s.1.5.3.7c.2.2.4.3.7.3h11c.3 0 .5-.1.7-.3.2-.2.3-.5.3-.7s-.1-.5-.3-.7zM5.8 14.7l6.2 6.3 6.2-6.3c.2-.2.3-.5.3-.7s-.1-.5-.3-.7c-.2-.2-.4-.3-.7-.3h-11c-.3 0-.5.1-.7.3-.2.2-.3.5-.3.7s.1.5.3.7z\"/></svg></span></span></span></a></span></div><nav><ul class='ez-toc-list ez-toc-list-level-1 eztoc-toggle-hide-by-default' ><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-1\" href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/the-beatles-white-album/#Personnel\" >Personnel</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-2\" href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/the-beatles-white-album/#Tracklisting\" >Tracklisting</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-3\" href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/the-beatles-white-album/#The_background\" >The background</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-4\" href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/the-beatles-white-album/2/#Planting_seeds_in_India\" >Planting seeds in India</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-5\" href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/the-beatles-white-album/2/#The_Kinfauns_demos\" >The Kinfauns demos</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-6\" href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/the-beatles-white-album/3/#In_the_studio\" >In the studio</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-7\" href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/the-beatles-white-album/4/#The_title_and_cover_artwork\" >The title and cover artwork</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-8\" href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/the-beatles-white-album/5/#Critical_reception\" >Critical reception</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-9\" href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/the-beatles-white-album/5/#Chart_success\" >Chart success</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-10\" href=\"#Charles_Manson_and_the_White_Album\" >Charles Manson and the White Album</a></li></ul></nav></div><h2><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Charles_Manson_and_the_White_Album\"></span>Charles Manson and the <em>White Album</em><span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2><p>In the months after its release, The Beatles were horrified to learn that Charles Manson had interpreted several of the <em>White Album</em>\u2019s songs as an incitement to commit murder and a prophecy of armageddon.</p><blockquote><div>Look at the songs: songs sung all over the world by the young love. It ain&#8217;t nothin&#8217; new\u2026 It&#8217;s written in\u2026 Revelation, all about the four angels programming the holocaust\u2026 the four angels looking for the fifth angel to lead the people into the pit of fire\u2026 right out to Death Valley. It&#8217;s all in black and white, in the <a href=\"/albums/the-beatles-white-album/\"><em>White Album</em></a> \u2013 white, so there ain&#8217;t no mistakin&#8217; the color.</div></blockquote><div class=\"source\">Charles Manson</div><p>Manson took particular notice of <a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/\">Paul McCartney</a>\u2019s <a href=\"/songs/helter-skelter/\">&#8216;Helter Skelter&#8217;</a>, a song about a fairground ride which was nonetheless interpreted as a prophecy of chaos, which he tied in with the New Testament&#8217;s Book of Revelation.</p><blockquote><div>Like, &#8216;Helter Skelter&#8217; is a nightclub. &#8216;Helter Skelter&#8217; means confusion. Literally. It doesn&#8217;t mean any war with anyone. It doesn&#8217;t mean that those people are going to kill other people. It only means what it means. &#8216;Helter Skelter&#8217; is confusion. Confusion is coming down fast. If you don&#8217;t see the confusion coming down fast, you can call it what you wish. It&#8217;s not my conspiracy. It is not my music. I hear what it relates. It says &#8216;Rise!&#8217; It says &#8216;Kill!&#8217; Why blame it on me? I didn&#8217;t write the music. I am not the person who projected it into your social consciousness.</div></blockquote><div class=\"source\">Charles Manson, November 1970</div><p>Read our feature on <a href=\"/features/charles-manson/\">Charles Manson and Helter Skelter</a>.</p><div class=\"epyt-video-wrapper\"><iframe  id=\"_ytid_72424\"  width=\"580\" height=\"435\"  data-origwidth=\"580\" data-origheight=\"435\"  data-relstop=\"1\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vWW2SzoAXMo?enablejsapi=1&#038;autoplay=0&#038;cc_load_policy=0&#038;cc_lang_pref=&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;loop=0&#038;rel=0&#038;fs=1&#038;playsinline=0&#038;autohide=2&#038;theme=dark&#038;color=red&#038;controls=1&#038;disablekb=0&#038;\" class=\"__youtube_prefs__  epyt-is-override  no-lazyload\" title=\"YouTube player\"  allow=\"fullscreen; accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen data-no-lazy=\"1\" data-skipgform_ajax_framebjll=\"\"></iframe></div><p>Five songs by The Beatles were particularly significant for Charles Manson, all from the <em>White Album</em>: &#8216;Helter Skelter&#8217;, <a href=\"/songs/revolution-1/\">&#8216;Revolution 1&#8217;</a>, <a href=\"/songs/revolution-9/\">&#8216;Revolution 9&#8217;</a>, <a href=\"/songs/blackbird/\">&#8216;Blackbird&#8217;</a>, and <a href=\"/songs/piggies/\">&#8216;Piggies&#8217;</a>. He also found hidden meanings in <a href=\"/songs/i-will/\">&#8216;I Will&#8217;</a>, <a href=\"/songs/honey-pie/\">&#8216;Honey Pie&#8217;</a>, <a href=\"/songs/glass-onion/\">&#8216;Glass Onion&#8217;</a>, <a href=\"/songs/dont-pass-me-by/\">&#8216;Don&#8217;t Pass Me By&#8217;</a>, <a href=\"/songs/sexy-sadie/\">&#8216;Sexy Sadie&#8217;</a>, <a href=\"/songs/rocky-raccoon/\">&#8216;Rocky Raccoon&#8217;</a>, and <a href=\"/songs/happiness-is-a-warm-gun/\">&#8216;Happiness Is A Warm Gun&#8217;</a>.</p><p>Read about <a href=\"/features/charles-manson/2/\">Charles Manson&#8217;s interpretations of The Beatles&#8217; songs</a>.</p><figure id=\"attachment_109011\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-109011\" style=\"width: 613px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"/gallery/lyrics/lyrics-helter-skelter_01/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-109011\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI2MTMiIGhlaWdodD0iOTYwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgNjEzIDk2MCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"109011\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/lyrics/lyrics-helter-skelter_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-helter-skelter_01-1.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1373,2150\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Lyrics for Helter Skelter, transcribed by Mal Evans\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"&lt;p&gt;Lyrics for Helter Skelter, transcribed by Mal Evans&lt;/p&gt;\n\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-helter-skelter_01-1-613x960.jpg\" data-src=\"/wp/media/lyrics-helter-skelter_01-1-613x960.jpg\" alt=\"Lyrics for Helter Skelter, transcribed by Mal Evans\" width=\"613\" height=\"960\" class=\"size-large wp-image-109011\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-helter-skelter_01-1-613x960.jpg 613w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-helter-skelter_01-1-370x580.jpg 370w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-helter-skelter_01-1-128x200.jpg 128w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-helter-skelter_01-1-768x1203.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-helter-skelter_01-1-981x1536.jpg 981w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-helter-skelter_01-1-1308x2048.jpg 1308w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-helter-skelter_01-1.jpg 1373w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 613px) 100vw, 613px\" /></a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-109011\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Lyrics for Helter Skelter, transcribed by Mal Evans</figcaption></figure><blockquote><div>All that Manson stuff was built around <a href=\"/people/george-harrison/\">George</a>\u2019s song about pigs and this one, Paul&#8217;s song about an English fairground. It has nothing to do with anything, and least of all to do with <em>me</em>.</div></blockquote><div class=\"source\">John Lennon, 1980<br />\n<a href=\"https://geni.us/allwearesaying\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><em>All We Are Saying</em></a>, David Sheff</div><p>Needless to say, Manson&#8217;s interpretations were wholly unintended by The Beatles, who later expressed anger and disgust at his actions.</p><blockquote><div>Charles Manson interpreted that &#8216;Helter Skelter&#8217; was something to do with the four horsemen of the Apocalypse. I still don&#8217;t know what all that stuff is; it&#8217;s from the Bible, Revelations \u2013 I haven&#8217;t read it so I wouldn&#8217;t know. But he interpreted the whole thing \u2013 that we were the four horsemen, &#8216;Helter Skelter&#8217; the song \u2013 and arrived at having to go out and kill everyone.</p><p>It was terrible. You can&#8217;t associate yourself with a thing like that. Some guy in the States had done it \u2013 but I&#8217;ve no idea why. It was frightening, because you don&#8217;t write songs for those reasons. Maybe some heavy metal groups do nowadays, but we certainly never did.</p></div></blockquote><div class=\"source\">Paul McCartney<br />\n<a href=\"https://geni.us/anthologypb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><em>Anthology</em></a></div><div class=\"spForumLink\"><span><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIxNiIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxNiIgdmlld0JveD0iMCAwIDE2IDE2Ij48cmVjdCB3aWR0aD0iMTAwJSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxMDAlIiBmaWxsPSIjY2ZkNGRiIi8+PC9zdmc+\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/wp-content/sp-resources/forum-plugins/blog-linking/resources/images/sp_BlogLink.png\" alt=\"sp_BlogLink\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /> <a href=\"/fab-forum/white-album/\">Join the Fab Forum discussion on the White Album</a> \u00bb</span></div><div class=\"page-links\">Pages: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/the-beatles-white-album/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">1</span></a> <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/the-beatles-white-album/2/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">2</span></a> <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/the-beatles-white-album/3/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">3</span></a> <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/the-beatles-white-album/4/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">4</span></a> <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/albums/the-beatles-white-album/5/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">5</span></a> <span class=\"post-page-numbers current\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"page-link\">6</span></span></div>",
